flowchart LR
  Bar[Frozen quality bar] --> Blind[Blind review packet]
  Artifact[Artifacts] --> Blind
  Verification[Verification report] --> Blind
  Blind --> Critique[CritiqueReport]
  Critique --> Findings[Severity, confidence, residual risk]
  Findings --> Stop{Critical open finding?}
  Stop -- yes --> Halt[STOP or ESCALATE]
  Stop -- no --> Gates[Required gates]
  Gates --> Decision[QualityReport and delivery decision]
  Decision --> Iteration[Bounded repair iteration]
  Iteration --> Blind
